{"term": {"label": "信", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-ii", "title": "盡心下", "description": "孟子曰：「不仁哉，梁惠王也！仁者以其所愛及其所不愛，不仁者以其所不愛及其所愛。」\n公孫丑問曰：「何謂也？」\n「梁惠王以土地之故，糜爛其民而戰之，大敗，將復之，恐不能勝，故驅其所愛子弟以殉之，是之謂以其所不愛及其所愛也。」\n孟子曰：「《春秋》無義戰。彼善於此，則有之矣。征者上伐下也，敵國不相征也。」\n孟子曰：「盡信《書》", "occurrences": 8, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "世", "id": "世"}, {"form": "亂", "id": "亂"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "伐", "id": "伐"}, {"form": "似", "id": "似"}, {"form": "信", "variants": [], "id": "信"}, {"form": "勝", "id": "勝"}, {"form": "去", "id": "去"}, {"form": "名", "id": "名"}, {"form": "周", "id": "周"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "德", "id": "德"}, {"form": "恐", "id": "恐"}, {"form": "惡", "id": "惡"}, {"form": "愛", "id": "愛"}, {"form": "敵", "id": "敵"}, {"form": "數", "id": "數"}, {"form": "用", "id": "用"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "絜", "id": "絜"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "道", "id": "道"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.1026086009613705, "source": "禮", "target": "亂"}, {"weight": 2.5726122302071057, "source": "禮", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 3.0834378539730967, "source": "禮", "target": "周"}, {"weight": 2.2361399935858928, "source": "禮", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 3.0834378539730967, "source": "禮", "target": "至"}, {"weight": 3.0834378539730967, "source": "絜", "target": "似"}, {"weight": 2.5726122302071057, "source": "絜", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 0.15224410155667667, "source": "人", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.557709209664841, "source": "人", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 0.9631743177730056, "source": "人", "target": "敵"}, {"weight": 1.6563214983329508, "source": "人", "target": "名"}, {"weight": 0.04688358589885046, "source": "人", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 0.2700271372130602, "source": "人", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 1.6563214983329508, "source": "人", "target": "數"}, {"weight